  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCOOPANAB Cocoa Production Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCOOPANAB is a cooperative of 832 coffee and cacao farmers. The grant intends to improve the cooperative&apos;s ability to buy, transport, and market its members produce through acquisitions of trucks, a Fair Trade certification and a revolving fund for crop purchase.</narrative>
  </description>
